  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Solution": "Evaluate the parentheses first: \\(6\\div3=2\\). Then multiply before adding:\n\\[\n-15+9\\times2=-15+18=3.\n\\]\nThe value is \\(3\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
